---
const terms = [
  {
    lead: "The diagnosis is on us.",
    body: "Our technicians capture the readings, Cliff's team designs the program, and we verify the floor at your meter. You owe nothing to find out.",
    mint: true,
  },
  {
    lead: "Our fee is fixed, and it triggers only on verification.",
    body: "Not a share of your savings forever, and not a number pulled from a projection. One fixed fee, owed only once the savings are measured at your building.",
    mint: false,
  },
  {
    lead: "It can be financed and structured to be cash-flow positive from month one.",
    body: "Because the verified savings begin immediately while the fee is spread over time, your monthly savings are designed to exceed your monthly payment from the start. You are net positive while you pay it off.",
    mint: false,
  },
  {
    lead: "Utility programs may cover much of the cost.",
    body: "Where available and approved, utility incentive programs can fund a large share of the project, reducing what you finance and widening your positive cash flow once the incentive lands. Availability and amount depend on your utility, so we confirm what you qualify for before you sign.",
    mint: false,
  },
];
---

<section class="section pay" id="how-you-pay" aria-labelledby="pay-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pay__head reveal">
      <h2 class="pay__title" id="pay-title">
        How you pay, only after it's real.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="pay__list">
      {
        terms.map((t, i) => (
          <li class={`pay__item reveal${t.mint ? " pay__item--mint" : ""}`} style={`--i: ${i}`}>
            <p class="pay__lead">
              {t.mint && <span class="pay__dot" aria-hidden="true" />}
              {t.lead}
            </p>
            <p class="pay__body">{t.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pay {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 50% 45% at 5% 0%,
        rgba(70, 179, 146, 0.045),
        transparent 70%
      ),
      var(--bg);
  }
  .pay__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .pay__list {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 380px), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }
  .pay__item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    padding-top: var(--space-m);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .pay__item--mint {
    border-top-color: rgba(70, 179, 146, 0.45);
  }
  .pay__lead {
    position: relative;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .pay__item--mint .pay__lead {
    color: var(--mint);
  }
  .pay__dot {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--mint);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--mint-soft);
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .pay__dot.is-pulse::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: dotPulse 1.3s var(--ease-out-quart);
  }
  @keyframes dotPulse {
    from {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 var(--mint);
      opacity: 0.55;
    }
    to {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 16px transparent;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pay__dot.is-pulse::after {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
  .pay__body {
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
</style>
